falllinie-spike [--place] [--seconds N|--frames N] [--seed N] [--cell N] [--cells 1..7]
 [--render-size WxH] [--debug-view 0..5] [--palette 0..5] [--capture-dir PATH] [--receipt PATH] [--resize-check] [--source-sampler-precision] [--play|--autoplay] [--dual-screen] [--source-sky-hash] [--absolute-render-coordinates] [--muted] [--audio-buffer 256..4096 power-of-two] [--audio-mode buffered|direct] [--no-vinyl|--source-vinyl] [--dev-overlay] [--profile CSV] [--gpu-profile] [--no-vsync] [--fps N]
F3 cycles debug; C cycles six palettes; A/START or ENTER/SPACE starts; START/P/ESC pauses; SELECT/F2 toggles developer overlay; SELECT+Y/R new run; M mutes; F10 or SELECT+START quits. --dev-overlay starts gameplay title with overlay. SELECT-first chords restore pre-press visibility; F2 is independent.
